# Synthesis Page Template

Synthesis pages combine multiple sources to generate new insights.

## Frontmatter

```yaml
---
type: synthesis
title: "Synthesis Title"
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
tags: [tag1, tag2]
scope: topic | question | comparison
status: draft | review | complete
---
```

## Body Structure

```markdown
# Synthesis Title

## Question/Purpose

What question does this synthesis answer? What gap does it fill?

## Summary

Executive summary of findings (3-5 sentences).

## Key Insights

### Insight 1: Title
Detailed explanation supported by evidence.

**Evidence**:
- [[source-005|Source A]] supports this by...
- [[source-006|Source B]] provides contrasting view...

### Insight 2: Title
Another synthesized finding.

**Evidence**:
- [[claim-007|Specific claim]] from [[source-007]]
- Data from [[entity-008]]

## Sources Consulted

1. [[source-005|Source A]] - Relevant contribution
2. [[source-006|Source B]] - Key findings
3. [[source-007|Source C]] - Context or counterpoint

## Methodology

How was this synthesis created? What approach was taken?

## Open Questions

What remains unanswered? What needs further investigation?
```

